Description:It is your first main phase. You have Geological Appraiser (3/2; when it enters, if you cast it, discover 3) in hand with four red mana floating. Your library is Colossal Dreadmaw, Lightning Bolt, Colossal Dreadmaw. The opponent is at 3 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-discover-free-cast | Discover N exiles cards until a nonland card with mana value N or less and lets you cast it without paying its mana cost (CR 701.57a): the Appraiser can't attack, but discover 3 skips the Dreadmaw and casts Lightning Bolt free for 3
